    "steam_appid": 1754960,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/4b0ab70a5f8f9808bc161cde719fac16.poster.avif?t=1747310504\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/4b0ab70a5f8f9808bc161cde719fac16.webm?t=1747310504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/4b0ab70a5f8f9808bc161cde719fac16.mp4?t=1747310504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Astride In Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Be a part of the early development of Astride by joining the early access program. As our team continues to work on the game, we will be releasing frequent updates and collaborating with our community to shape the ultimate horse-riding experience. Be sure to read up on the currently available game features before purchasing, so you know exactly what to expect from the game. Astride is currently in a pre-alpha state.</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an early access title, Astride is still in development, but you can play and test out the features and game mechanics that have been implemented so far. You can expect limited features and some bugs as the game is still a work in progress. However, this presents an excellent opportunity for you to provide feedback and help shape the game's development with us. With each update, the game will become more polished and packed with new content, providing players with an exciting and evolving experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game's development team welcomes your feedback and suggestions as they work to refine and perfect the game. Your participation in shaping Astride's future is essential. To give feedback regarding Astride, please head over to the Steam discussion forums or join our official Discord server and use the respected channels and forums to provide your valuable feedback. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/273f996b4bf29f097ef802e7c250dcb7.poster.avif?t=1747310504\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/273f996b4bf29f097ef802e7c250dcb7.webm?t=1747310504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/273f996b4bf29f097ef802e7c250dcb7.mp4?t=1747310504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features Currently Available</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Horse customization -</strong> The Astride Horse Creator offers an array of horse genetic options for you to discover. Select different breeds, heights, head shapes, mane, tail, and forelock styles, base coat colors, face and leg markings, tobiano patterns, and different genetics, such as cream, grey, silver, splash, and more to customize your horse's appearance. Observe how the various genes influence the outcome of your horse's coat and bring your dream horse to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/67bf8a10673ad9732c4cf56004b8d08a.poster.avif?t=1747310504\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/67bf8a10673ad9732c4cf56004b8d08a.webm?t=1747310504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/67bf8a10673ad9732c4cf56004b8d08a.mp4?t=1747310504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer -</strong> Whether you prefer playing with friends or riding out alone, Astride offers a multiplayer feature. Explore the environment with your friends or complete strangers. You have the flexibility to host private servers with passcodes for intimate gatherings or join public servers to meet fellow players from around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/f7464f94f999105f0bbbe963ecea384f.poster.avif?t=1747310504\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/f7464f94f999105f0bbbe963ecea384f.webm?t=1747310504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/f7464f94f999105f0bbbe963ecea384f.mp4?t=1747310504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Show jumping prototype -</strong> The initial iteration of the show jumping system is now available for testing. Observe how strides impact the horse's jumping capabilities and master the art of creating the ideal lineup for jumping. Select between a variation of training courses and timed courses and compete against your friends for the best time scores! Try out the cross country jumps placed around the country-side and challenge yourself in rough terrain! Stay tuned for additional updates to the jumping prototype in the near future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/3cba7560628cc3edc8d741c9be5b7bc6.poster.avif?t=1747310504\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/3cba7560628cc3edc8d741c9be5b7bc6.webm?t=1747310504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/3cba7560628cc3edc8d741c9be5b7bc6.mp4?t=1747310504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dressage prototype -</strong> The dressage prototype is now available in Astride. Choose between a few different dressage tests and gain scores based on how well you can stick to the program. Follow the path and switch gaits at the perfect moment. Perform movements such as canter pirouette, passage, and piaffe! Dressage is still in development and will keep getting updates over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/b005da1e24bc55b0fdb3f17cb00f4bb1.poster.avif?t=1747310504\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/b005da1e24bc55b0fdb3f17cb00f4bb1.webm?t=1747310504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/b005da1e24bc55b0fdb3f17cb00f4bb1.mp4?t=1747310504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
