0628cc3edc8d741c9be5b7bc6.poster.avif?t=1747310504\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/3cba7560628cc3edc8d741c9be5b7bc6.webm?t=1747310504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/3cba7560628cc3edc8d741c9be5b7bc6.mp4?t=1747310504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dressage prototype -</strong> The dressage prototype is now available in Astride. Choose between a few different dressage tests and gain scores based on how well you can stick to the program. Follow the path and switch gaits at the perfect moment. Perform movements such as canter pirouette, passage, and piaffe! Dressage is still in development and will keep getting updates over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/b005da1e24bc55b0fdb3f17cb00f4bb1.poster.avif?t=1747310504\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/b005da1e24bc55b0fdb3f17cb00f4bb1.webm?t=1747310504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754960/extras/b005da1e24bc55b0fdb3f17cb00f4bb1.mp4?t=1747310504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
